{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_66","type":"agent_message","text":"The final review caught a few presentation gaps: detached flagship sockets, a partly hidden bonus saucer and missing hit cues. Those are fixed, along with visible salvage expiry and the victory celebration. I’m now running the combined verification command against the final exported HTML and checking that the interview JSON matches the in-game credits.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_67","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\ncfg=json.loads(Path('build-config.json').read_text());p=Path(cfg['folder'])\nf=p/'src/view.js';s=f.read_text().replace(\\\"r.W/2,extra-30,'#557e7a'\\\", \\\"r.W/2,extra-8,'#557e7a'\\\");f.write_text(s)\nf=p/'report.json';a=json.loads(f.read_text());a['testingFeedback']=[\n '25 unique issues were found and fixed through automated tests, native API/contract reviews and screenshot inspection. Repeated failures from the same cause are counted once; test-pilot timing and observation mistakes are excluded. The issue ledger is evidence/ISSUES.md.',\n '2 critical defects: classic-script export syntax prevented boot, and a null native pad selector disabled solo controller discovery. Both are fixed and covered by regressions.',\n 'Ordinary-input STANDARD solo and co-op campaigns through all six formations and both flagship phases, using normal damage and resources. Native-controller and live Hub checks then verified that the same rules survive integration.',\n 'Menu screenshots captured before the entrance animation settled were least helpful. State assertions and settled screenshots gave clearer evidence.'\n]\na['engineFeedback'][1]='I initially used incorrect native setting names and treated a null pad selector as automatic discovery. Reading the actual engine contracts and native regressions resolved these. The arcade helper also alternates turns, so simultaneous co-op uses the explicit shared world.'\na['sourceInformation']['testing']='One quiet command runs deterministic simulation and native headless drawing, ordinary-input complete STANDARD solo/co-op campaigns, Chromium integration, Firefox/WebKit smoke, emulated pads/phone/tablet, generated audio signal/mute probes, blocked/malformed storage and the pinned Hub harness with loss, latency, host departure and server hosting. Physical controller feel, human listening, real TV distance and real iOS behavior remain unknown.'\na['sourceInformation']['environment']='Codex CLI (headless); Linux / Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS on WSL2; Node24.21.0; Python Playwright1.63.0; Chromium153.0.8010.12, Firefox155.0 and WebKit26.6.'\na['sourceInformation']['animation']='Native E.anim march poses, cannon recoil/readiness, armor break, bunker debris and repair highlights, saucer wobble, flagship emitters/core windows and planetary victory fireworks on the native fixed clock.'\ntext=json.dumps(a,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n';f.write_text(text);Path('exit-interview.json').write_text(text)\nf=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=f.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Final verification underway\\\\n- All implementation agents finished. Source module ownership consolidated.\\\\n- Final unique issue ledger:25 fixed issues,2 critical (classic-script boot syntax and solo pad discovery); includes contract/visual review, excludes test-fixture mistakes.\\\\n- Browser latest full run110/111; final failure was a test observing surviving bullets instead of creation. Corrected event-based assertion focused group8/8. Final aggregate now reruns all checks against the exact current build.\\\\n- Added final visible planet celebration, flagship/saucer hit sounds and bursts, expiry warning, honest Hub round-void results, saucer/HUD lane clearance.\\\\n- report.json and root exit-interview.json finalized with actual evidence and limitations; the same object is embedded in About/Credits.\\\\n- Next: run node tools/build.mjs then node tools/test.mjs, inspect final visual evidence, confirm all artifacts and update completion status here.\\\\n''';f.write_text(s)\nPY\nnode Orbit-Invadettes-Astro-Battle-Space-Invaders-1979-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022709/tools/build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
