ng, real TV distance and real iOS behavior remain unknown.'\na['sourceInformation']['environment']='Codex CLI (headless); Linux / Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS on WSL2; Node24.21.0; Python Playwright1.63.0; Chromium153.0.8010.12, Firefox155.0 and WebKit26.6.'\na['sourceInformation']['animation']='Native E.anim march poses, cannon recoil/readiness, armor break, bunker debris and repair highlights, saucer wobble, flagship emitters/core windows and planetary victory fireworks on the native fixed clock.'\ntext=json.dumps(a,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n';f.write_text(text);Path('exit-interview.json').write_text(text)\nf=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=f.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Final verification underway\\\\n- All implementation agents finished. Source module ownership consolidated.\\\\n- Final unique issue ledger:25 fixed issues,2 critical (classic-script boot syntax and solo pad discovery); includes contract/visual review, excludes test-fixture mistakes.\\\\n- Browser latest full run110/111; final failure was a test observing surviving bullets instead of creation. Corrected event-based assertion focused group8/8. Final aggregate now reruns all checks against the exact current build.\\\\n- Added final visible planet celebration, flagship/saucer hit sounds and bursts, expiry warning, honest Hub round-void results, saucer/HUD lane clearance.\\\\n- report.json and root exit-interview.json finalized with actual evidence and limitations; the same object is embedded in About/Credits.\\\\n- Next: run node tools/build.mjs then node tools/test.mjs, inspect final visual evidence, confirm all artifacts and update completion status here.\\\\n''';f.write_text(s)\nPY\nnode Orbit-Invadettes-Astro-Battle-Space-Invaders-1979-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022709/tools/build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"Orbit-Invadettes-Astro-Battle-Space-Invaders-1979-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022709.html\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
