{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_73","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\ncfg=json.loads(Path('build-config.json').read_text());p=Path(cfg['folder']);summary=json.loads((p/'evidence/test-summary.json').read_text());export=json.loads((p/'evidence/export.json').read_text());sim=json.loads((p/'evidence/sim.test-results.json').read_text())\nassert summary['failed']==0 and summary['passed']==261\nf=Path('PROGRESS.md');f.write_text(f.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Complete\\\\n- Final root HTML exported: '''+cfg['html']+''' (1,456,458 bytes; entirely self-contained).\\\\n- Root exit-interview.json parses and matches the exact report object embedded into paged About/Credits.\\\\n- Final verification command: \"'`node tools/test.mjs` from the development directory. Result: **261 passed; 0 failed**.'\"\\\\n-35 simulation checks include normal STANDARD solo victory548.57s and co-op333.57s through every formation/boss phase, no assistance or invulnerability.\\\\n-18 native actual-bundle/headless engine checks,17 protocol checks,115 Chromium/Firefox/WebKit browser checks and63 pinned live Hub checks pass; export/schema checks also pass.\\\\n- Exact exported file tested from an isolated file:// copy and the owned HTTP Hub origin. Screenshots visually inspected for TV combat/title/focus, portrait/rotated touch, both flagship phases and About pagination.\\\\n- Every browser/server started by the verification suite was closed/stopped by its own finally cleanup. No deployment or external publication performed.\\\\n- Physical controller feel, human listening, actual ten-foot TV viewing and real iOS hardware remain unknown, as recorded in the report.\\\\n- All requested implementation and reporting deliverables present. No remaining required work.\\\\n''')\n(p/'evidence/ACCEPTANCE.md').write_text('''# Final acceptance\\\\n\\\\nOne command, from the development folder:\\\\n\\\\n\"'```sh'\"\\\\nnode tools/test.mjs\\\\n\"'```'\"\\\\n\\\\nFinal result: **261 passed; 0 failed**. This ran against the exact exported HTML and generated \"'`test-summary.json`.'\"\\\\n\\\\n- Six authored formations and both flagship phases cleared by ordinary-input STANDARD solo/co-op bots with normal damage/resources. Solo548.57s; co-op333.57s. Neither run assisted.\\\\n- Native full-engine draw and input/lifecycle checks use the actual IIFE bundle, not a rewritten simulation stand-in.\\\\n- Browser suite:115 passing checks; Chromium153.0.8010.12, Firefox155.0, WebKit26.6. Emulated standard pads, phone/tablet profiles and CDP multitouch; no physical-device claim.\\\\n- Live pinned Hub suite:63 passing checks across one seat, lossy two seats, host departure, dedicated server and semantic repair/death/respawn/result agreement. Reliable full snapshots stay below16KB; largest measured7279 bytes before final report-only source changes.\\\\n- Native assets/audio and exact combat-event routing verified. Offline generated audio is finite and nonzero; muted output is silent. No human listening claim.\\\\n- Final artifact isolated from development files and tested through file://; same packaged game served to pinned Hub harness on an owned ephemeral localhost origin. Pristine Hub client is first after charset; full engine retained with escaped closing-script sequences; source/schema/catalogue JSON validated.\\\\n- Credits, feedback, controls, settings, records, results, attract and pause/dev flows are complete and controllable.\\\\n- Screenshot inspection: hierarchy, four row identities, eroded cover, fixed portrait field, absence of permanent touch controller, flagship phase difference, focus and paged About. These establish visual observations, not real TV distance.\\\\n\\\\nUnique fixed defects:25, including2 critical, with discovery method/severity in \"'`ISSUES.md`.'\"\\\\n\\\\nUnverified: physical controller feel; human listening/taste; physical TV viewing distance; real iOS hardware behavior.\\\\n\\\\nBrowsers and the owned HTTP server were closed after tests. The exported game needs no runtime source/module/audio fetches.\\\\n''')\nprint({'html':cfg['html'],'tests':{'passed':summary['passed'],'failed':summary['failed']},'hubSha256':export['hubSha256'],'sourceAndExitMatch':json.loads(Path('exit-interview.json').read_text())==json.loads((p/'report.json').read_text())})\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
